sender = "Carol"
subject = "Parallax Accommodations Policy"
body = "Hi,

Welcome to Parallax! We want to ensure that you’re taken care of not only as an employee, but as a human. As such, if you need any such accommodations, please let us know.

Some examples may include:
[ul]Different desk chair with better support[/ul]
[ul]Service animals[/ul]
[ul]Shortened meeting times (up to 2h max)[/ul]
[ul]Dress code modifications[/ul]

If you need anything, please don’t hesitate to let us know.

Carol
[i]Sr. Human Resources Manager[/i]
Parallax

----------

